    "directions": [
      "Firstly, take 5 chapatis and roll tight.",
      "Cut into thin strips forming noodles.",
      "Separate the chapati strips and keep aside.",
      "Now, in a wok heat oil and saute garlic, green chilli, onion, carrot, cabbage, capsicum for 1 minute on high heat.",
      "Saute slightly till the vegetables shrink.",
      "Now add salt, tomato ketchup, vinegar, soy sauce and mix well making sure sauces are combined well.",
      "Then add the prepared chapati strips and toss it well.",
      "Finally, serve chapati noodles hot and garnish with spring onion."
    ],
